### 2. Bug Fix Pattern
```
1. Reproduce + Analyze (Sequential)
2. Fix + Test (Parallel)
3. Verify + Document (Parallel)
4. Deploy + Monitor (Sequential)
```

### 3. Refactoring Pattern
