### Database Sharding

```typescript
// Shard by domain for horizontal scaling
const shards = {
  'domain-a': await createAgentDBAdapter({ dbPath: '.agentdb$shard-a.db' }),
  'domain-b': await createAgentDBAdapter({ dbPath: '.agentdb$shard-b.db' }),
