2. "Analyze root causes"
3. "Design solution"
4. "Implement solution"
5. "Verify implementation"
```

### 3. Appropriate Timeouts

- Simple tasks: 30 seconds (default)
- Analysis tasks: 45-60 seconds
- Implementation tasks: 60-90 seconds
